### Create crawl for user 1 project
POST {{api_url}}/projects/{{project_id1}}/crawls
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config_snapshot": {
    "max_depth": 3,
    "respect_robots_txt": true,
    "enable_javascript": false
  }
}

### List crawls for user 1 project
GET {{api_url}}/projects/{{project_id1}}/crawls
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token1}}

### Get one crawl as user 1
GET {{api_url}}/crawls/{{crawl_id1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token1}}

### Forbidden create in user 1 project as user 2
POST {{api_url}}/projects/{{project_id1}}/crawls
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config_snapshot": {
    "max_depth": 1
  }
}

### Forbidden list in user 1 project as user 2
GET {{api_url}}/projects/{{project_id1}}/crawls
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token2}}

### Hidden crawl as user 2
GET {{api_url}}/crawls/{{crawl_id1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token2}}
